cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HeartFEM_Mu"
abstract: "Mechanics of a beating heart-chamber wall reconstructed from 4D images, solved by finite elements (legacy FEniCS) or by a physics-informed neural network, with the material and activation laws of heartFEM: volume-driven P-V cycle, Windkessel (closed-loop circulation) coupling, and inversion of the passive stiffness and peak active tension."
authors:
  - family-names: "Mu"
    given-names: "Siyu"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SiyuMU/HeartFEM_Mu"
keywords:
  - cardiac mechanics
  - finite elements
  - physics-informed neural network
  - zebrafish heart
  - Windkessel
